WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:11.230
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, and it’s time
for our season 4 preview of Arya.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:14.460
The last time we saw her she was getting some
revenge for the events of the Red Wedding.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.199
So I wanted to talk a little about her role
on the show and where the character is headed

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:17.199
in season 4.

00:00:17.199 --> 00:00:22.640
Like I’ve said in all my other previews,
I won’t be referencing too many specific

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.090
events but beware minor spoilers for seasons
1 through 3.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:32.259
Arya is like everyone’s little sister on
the show and I’ve always thought that she

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:35.370
kind of represents lost innocence in a way
that Sansa doesn’t.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.120
Even though Arya has always been very different
from what you would expect of a princess in

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.950
a fantasy story, she really has gotten darker
and darker since season 1.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:51.089
I really think the turning point for her character
wasn’t the Red Wedding, it was Harrenhal.

00:00:51.089 --> 00:00:53.202
Remember that was the first time she said
her death prayer on the show.

00:00:53.202 --> 00:00:57.809
I think Jacken too kind of introduced her
to the idea that revenge was possible when

00:00:57.809 --> 00:01:00.530
he started killing the people she named.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:10.710
But If you’ve read the books then I think
you’ll be really surprised in season 4.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:14.420
I think that there’s a trip everyone is
expecting her character to take that they

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.830
won’t end up doing on the show till season
5.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:21.740
It’s this huge character arc for her character
and since they haven’t cast any of the necessary

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:27.580
roles yet I’m pretty sure we won’t see
it till after season 4.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:33.530
What does that mean for her character in season
4 and what is she going to be doing.

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.290
If you remember, she is still near the twins
at the end of season 3.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:37.290
So she’s pretty far north.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:39.110
If you look at the map of westeros too you
see that she’s between the Iron Islands

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:40.110
and The Eyrie.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:44.351
Think about the idea that during the last
couple of seasons and even in the books the

00:01:44.351 --> 00:01:48.280
main characters sometimes cross paths or travel
really near each other without knowing it.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:55.480
So does that mean that Arya is going to run
into more of the other characters and which

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.210
ones?

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:00.440
I don’t think she’ll see Gendry again
this season unless she goes to the wall.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.840
But I’ll talk more about him in a separate
video.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:08.259
She’s not going back to Kings Landing with
the Hound, but I do think she’ll continue

00:02:08.259 --> 00:02:10.570
to travel with him for most of season 4.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:13.260
Let me know where you think arya will be this
season.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.660
Will she stay in the riverlands?

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:23.469
There are some pretty big events that happen
there at the end of book 3.

00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:28.690
Do you think she’ll travel to the eyrie
or somewhere else?

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:31.360
One place I don’t think she’ll be going
is The Wall.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:36.580
Since the Hound is looking to make money off
her safe return I think he’ll try to take

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:41.430
her to the eyrie but something will happen
and she’ll run away before the end of the

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.430
season.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.940
But let me know what you think.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:49.639
I’m expecting some more amazing unintentionally
funny moments from arya and the hound this

00:02:49.639 --> 00:02:50.639
season.

00:02:50.639 --> 00:02:54.290
Remember in one of my other season 4 previews
I talked about how they were like this awesome

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.379
comedy duo.

00:02:55.379 --> 00:03:06.870
I wonder if they write those characters to
be 

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:14.510
funny together or if the actors just perform
it that way.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:19.579
Maisie Williams is actually one of the new
most popular actors on the show, not just

00:03:19.579 --> 00:03:25.680
because her character is awesome, but because
she is like the queen of vines right now.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.999
Here’s a couple of her vine videos.

00:03:26.999 --> 00:03:30.180
Be sure to let me know which one is your favorite.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:40.230
And if you’re not, be sure to follow her
on twitter so you can see all her new ones.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:47.500
A lot of people requested I do a preview for
Dany, so that will be my next preview.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.989
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:03:48.989 --> 00:03:51.069
I’ll post that on monday.

00:03:51.069 --> 00:03:56.499
In the meantime keep telling me which characters
you want to talk about the most.

00:03:56.499 --> 00:04:02.120
You can click here to watch my Jaime preview
and you can click here for my tyrion preview.

